    "headline": "ms_apply_plus_factor",
    "note": "per-contingency cost; Jacobian factorization and base solve are amortized over the 186 contingencies of their scenario. Headline charges apply + factorization (parity with the surrogate, which is charged predict time but not fit time); the strictest accounting also charges the base solve."
